WEBVTT

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:09.420
Hey, is that big bag yours, Mana?

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:09.990
Yeah!

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.820
What did you bring?

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.690
Heh, that's a secret!

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:16.160
We shall arrive shortly.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.990
So, will you finally tell us?

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.860
What will our final trial be?

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:27.840
You have all grown much over this summer's rigid training.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.260
To tie it all together,

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:35.120
you shall acquire one of the three Sacred Treasures obtained by the Precures of ten thousand years ago.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:38.310
Specifically, the Crystal Mirror.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.600
The Crystal Mirror?

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:42.030
{OP}

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:48.240
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.710
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:53.580
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.600
Every day it sparkles

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.270
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:06.180
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:11.850
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:17.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:22.940
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:28.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:37.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.190
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:39.190 --> 00:01:41.590
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.430
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:47.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:51.100
is our promise between girls

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:57.140
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:57.180 --> 00:02:03.050
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:14.980
Final Trial!

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:14.980
Final Trial!

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.640
Long ago,

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:22.470
back when the universe was still enveloped in darkness,

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:30.100
the legendary warriors known as the Precures appeared.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.360
They came to deliver love and peace to the world!

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:38.280
The spear of light that could pierce any obstacle, Miracle Dragon Glaive! {oh come the fuck on}

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:44.430
The mirror of crystal that could reflect any truth, Magical Lovely Pad! {really Toei}

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:51.680
And the coronet of gold imbued with boundless wisdom, Eternal Golden Crown! {God damn it is really hard to translate "golden crown" without using either gold or crown.}

00:02:56.570 --> 00:02:58.700
By employing these three Sacred Treasures,

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.830
these women dispelled the darkness, according to legend.

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.450
Wait, I've heard this before...

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.700
The Miracle Dragon Glaive...

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:11.340
That was the name of the spear the princess wielded!

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:17.880
Indeed, I've heard that the Trump Kingdom princess wielded the spear of light.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:23.810
And to think that King Selfish sealed the princess away with that spear's own power...

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:28.180
So, the crystal mirror that we'll be searching for...

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.860
holds the same power as that spear?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.510
That it does.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.700
Makopi?

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.760
I'm worried...

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:43.080
I feel that if we fail here, we'll be back at square one.

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.730
Don't worry.

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:46.340
This is what we've been training for!

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:48.870
Mana is right.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.150
We're not just saving Trump Kingdom.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:55.060
We've also got to get Regina back!

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:58.190
That's right.

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:05.500
What happened?

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.590
A near miss.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:09.000
Pwane! Pwane!

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.570
Huh? Where?

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.680
What the Chell is that?!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:24.380
What're you askin' me for?!

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.160
Please fasten your seatbelts.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.560
We're making an emergency landing!

00:04:39.820 --> 00:04:42.120
Are you girls all right?

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:44.530
Yes, somehow.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.900
What is it?

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.100
I lost my glasses...

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.580
Do your glasses matter more than your life?

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:54.840
Maybe...

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.120
Oh, Rikka...

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.080
It's been a while, Aguri.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:06.920
I'd have never thought you were on that plane.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.240
Melan!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.010
Do you know her?

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.990
For ten thousand long years,

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:15.490
this fairy has protected the Crystal Mirror!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:20.700
Is she a Precure's partner like us?

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.290
Nice to meet you!

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.910
I'm Aida Mana!

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:27.380
Always so quick to adapt...

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:33.680
We absolutely must have that Crystal Mirror!

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:39.990
We came to obtain the power fit only for the legendary Precure warriors!

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.960
I beg you, please give us the Crystal Mirror!

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:52.830
Very well.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:58.740
After such persistent requests, I have no choice...

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:02.880
but to put your strength to the test myself! {start on "omaetachi"}

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:15.960
This can't be happening!

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:20.930
Is that...

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.860
the dinosaur we saw earlier?

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.210
I don't think so!

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:29.870
For one thing,

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:34.380
dinosaurs don't breathe fire!

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.530
What a magnificent beast!

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:37.840
Sebastian!

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:38.830
No, you may not.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.580
Now, this way.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:41.950
Hm?

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:51.590
What's wrong? Lost your nerve?

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:59.230
And yet you dare bear the name of legendary warriors?

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.370
If you wish to obtain the Crystal Mirror,

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.540
then you must first defeat me!

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.290
Is this our final trial?

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.510
Well, it certainly doesn't disappoint.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:10.440
Let's go, girls!

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.480
Right!

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:14.250
Charles!

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.190
Precure Love Link!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.230
L-O-V-E!

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:19.990
L-O-V-E!

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:20.680
L-O-V-E!

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:21.840
L-O-V-E!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:39.680
Brimming with love,

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:41.960
Cure Heart!

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.120
The light of wisdom,

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.510
Cure Diamond!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:52.630
The warmth of the sun,

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.950
Cure Rosetta!

00:07:56.320 --> 00:07:57.610
The blade of courage,

00:07:58.460 --> 00:07:59.760
Cure Sword!

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:05.350
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.050
Dokidoki Precure!

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:13.230
You cannot defeat me with numbers alone!

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:14.960
We have more than numbers alone!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:15.750
Oh?

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:19.300
I've obtained true power, as well!

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.350
Ai, let us begin!

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:24.520
Precure Dress Up!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.940
Kyupirappa!

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.270
Love's trump card,

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.200
Cure Ace!

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:19.540
Hmph. It'll be easier to crush you all at once!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.720
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:34.800
Precure Double Kick!

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:40.810
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:44.980
Pretty cool, right?

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:51.350
You dare attempt to freeze me in ice?

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:53.170
You're a million years too green to succeed!

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.450
She's strong...

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:56.560
You mustn't lose faith.

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:58.880
We must combine our strengths as one!

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:01.540
You're right. Let's do it, girls!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.350
Right!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:13.090
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.590
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:25.310
Ace Shot!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:26.540
Bang!

00:10:36.430 --> 00:10:37.450
But how?

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:40.650
Our attacks didn't even scratch her!

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:44.630
Is that all that Precures these days can muster?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.030
This is the end!

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.650
Never knew there was a fairy <i>that</i> strong.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:16.360
Aguri, you seemed to know Melan.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:20.690
It was before I sought to become a Precure.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:27.410
I was led to this island by a mysterious power.

00:11:27.730 --> 00:11:31.740
That was when I met Melan, who told me this...

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:34.930
You say you want the Crystal Mirror?

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:41.210
The only ones I may entrust it to are the legendary Precure warriors.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.060
Return once you are one.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:50.830
I can't reach the stage on which the legendary warriors stood on my strength alone.

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.950
With that realization,

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:58.620
I decided to search for partners with whom I could train and, together, reach ever greater heights.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:03.270
So that would be why you trained so much with us.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.240
But I failed...

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:10.990
I'm further from that legendary stage than I ever imagined...

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.880
This isn't over yet!

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:15.250
Mana?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:20.810
You're never going to get anywhere if you give up after a slip or two!

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:22.960
If we just bowed out right now,

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:27.000
that'll mean my only summer break as a 14-year-old will have been for nothing!

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.590
Sebastian!

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.160
Wait, Mana?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.530
What did you bring?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.940
Cooking utensils, as you can see.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:38.450
Let's eat some dinner for now.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:41.410
Thou canst not do battle on an empty stomacheth!

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:43.380
Know how to cook this?

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.580
No...

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.750
Then you do it, Rikka.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.840
I'll peel the vegetables.

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:52.150
Alice and Makopi, you two can gather kindling and get a fire going.

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:53.050
Sure.

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:54.670
Um...

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:58.490
Could you possibly teach me to cook, too?

00:12:58.490 --> 00:13:00.430
You got it, partner!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:09.300
Countless warriors have come to challenge me for this mirror over the years...

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.100
However...

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:18.590
I've seen not one with a heart as strong as yours.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:23.020
What is that scent?

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.560
Dinnertime!

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:31.430
What is this flavor?

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:33.180
It's delicious!

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:35.530
It's so mild and rich...

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:39.090
Simmered food tastes the best!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:40.110
You!

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:42.020
Melan!

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:44.600
I recall telling you to leave!

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.580
Did you come to play games?

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:50.890
Aw, don't be like that. Have a bite.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.450
Curry tastes better the more people eat it.

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.720
Eat up!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.470
Is something wrong?

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:16.840
Is it too spicy?

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:23.310
You know, I've always lived alone on this island.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:29.790
It's been ten thousand years since I've had a meal with someone...

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:35.260
So my stomach simply acted up out of surprise.

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:40.730
Eating food with others tastes this wonderful, does it?

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:45.200
I have people I'd like to eat this curry with, too.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:54.710
I don't know what's happened to Regina, so I can't help but worry,

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:57.390
even though I have no way to find her...

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:04.310
If I could, I'd like to bring Regina back right this instant.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:09.160
I'd like to awaken the princess and restore Trump Kingdom!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:13.130
But I have to become stronger if I want to do that!

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:15.550
That is none of my concern.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.800
Now, finish your meal and leave.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:18.960
We won't leave!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:19.930
Mana!

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:23.740
I beg of you as well, please give us another chance!

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.290
Please!

00:15:25.290 --> 00:15:26.210
Please!

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:39.760
There is a cave at the foot of that mountain.

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:42.300
We shall settle this there at dawn.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:44.440
Thanks!

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:02.890
Thank you!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:08.140
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:14.260
That barrier's such a pain!

00:16:14.260 --> 00:16:18.430
I shall strike it with a Rosetta Reflection to cancel it out!

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.240
You can't do that alone!

00:16:20.240 --> 00:16:22.260
Then how about us four do it?

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:25.520
We can use a Lovely Force Arrow,

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:28.740
so maybe we can use a Lovely Force Reflection?

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.230
Sounds like it's worth a try!

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.860
I shall draw Melan's attention!

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:37.680
Take the chance to attack!

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.810
You got it!

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:40.360
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.140
Ace Shot!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.480
Bang!

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.690
No matter how often you try, it will always end the same!

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.160
Now!

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:54.150
We'll give our power to Rosetta!

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:01.440
Precure Lovely Force Reflection!

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.240
That's kinda small!

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:05.100
Here we go!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:19.280
What?

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:20.710
We did it!

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:21.760
Now!

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.450
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:24.650
Ace Shot—

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:26.630
Oh no!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.400
Five minutes have passed!

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:29.870
Fools!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:37.170
Cure Heart!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.120
What's wrong? Through already?

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:48.830
Where is the vigor I saw before?

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.820
Do you not want to save your friends?

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:56.330
Is this all your heart can muster?

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:58.500
Not even...

00:17:58.500 --> 00:17:59.840
close!

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:02.960
I won't...

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.530
<i>We</i> won't...

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.510
ever give up!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:16.910
Not until we save Trump Kingdom!

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.240
If there's even a one in a million chance...

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:27.950
Then we shall fight to our last breath!

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:29.140
Girls...

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:34.130
We'll become stronger and stronger.

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:35.730
And once we have...

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:39.100
we'll meet Regina once again!

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:46.100
Impudent!

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:56.180
Burn!

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:00.590
Cure Heart!

00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.120
What?!

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:30.720
Mana!

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:32.100
Why you...

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:47.720
Cure Empress...

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:04.920
You've awakened?

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:06.770
Sebastian...

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:11.900
Wait, did we lose again?!

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:13.880
No freaking way!

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:16.890
Okay, first comes lunch, then we take another shot!

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:20.600
We can't quit until we get that Crystal Mirror!

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:21.870
Which would be this!

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:24.580
That's... the Crystal Mirror?

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:32.430
Long ago, we wagered our lives in a battle against an evil that appeared on this planet.

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:33.790
"We"?

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:39.090
While our comrades fell one by one, and all hope seemed lost,

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:44.190
my partner, Cure Empress, smiled and said this...

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:49.630
I won't ever give up!

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:54.170
You remind me so much of her.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:55.120
Melan...

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:57.880
You won't ever give up.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:03.610
One with as indomitable a spirit as yours will certainly make good use of it.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:04.620
Now take it.

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:06.950
Thank you, Melan!

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:10.060
Melan, I must thank you as well.

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:12.420
It has arrived.

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:15.390
Let's return home.

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.350
Um, do you want to come with?

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:21.830
I'd like you to fight the Selfish with us!

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.540
I'm afraid I can't.

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:25.140
Why not?

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:27.730
I've lived long enough.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:34.200
You'll be the ones to usher in a new era, which is why you should go.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.890
Now go.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:39.410
Save the people who wait for your rescue.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:44.120
Thank you, Melan.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:52.530
<i>Is this enough, Cure Empress?</i>

00:21:55.490 --> 00:21:58.290
<i>Their true trial begins now.</i>

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:01.480
<i>Do not waver, Precures!</i>

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:05.480
{ED}

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:08.450
Oh no!

00:22:08.450 --> 00:22:11.980
Leva and Gura turned everyone in the city into Selfishes!

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:13.870
King Selfish will revive if we do nothing!

00:22:14.270 --> 00:22:16.060
We must do whatever we can to stop them!

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:20.680
The only way out of this crisis is to use the legendary mirror's power!

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:22.390
Please, Mr. Legendary Mirror!

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:24.730
Lend us your power!

00:22:25.870 --> 00:22:27.500
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:31.590
Crisis in Oogai City!

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:31.590
Crisis in Oogai City!

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:33.530
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
